    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Chemist 10</p><p>The effects of the chemist's bombs are persistent and continue to damage creatures for 1 round after the initial damage. Creatures that take a direct hit from a sticky bomb take the splash damage 1 round later. Bombs that have effects that would normally occur 1 round later instead have those effects occur 2 rounds later.</p><p><em>* This discovery modifies bombs. Discoveries marked with an asterisk do not stack; only one such discovery can be applied to an individual bomb.</em></p>",
